    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0206" n="90" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg90"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/122.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American
                    Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1910-09-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 29, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>You may inform the Chinese Government that the Morgan syndicate state that they
                    will undertake the loan and the Department hopes the arrangements can soon be
                    made.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
